      "name": "ClosedXML extension information: ISERR excludes #N/A while ISNA recognizes it",
      "evidence": [
        "https://github.com/ClosedXML/ClosedXML/blob/09f2f21a60e821ce7fb18ca3576b272e5dd6d921/ClosedXML.Tests/Excel/CalcEngine/InformationTests.cs#L101: IsErr_NA_False",
        "https://github.com/ClosedXML/ClosedXML/blob/09f2f21a60e821ce7fb18ca3576b272e5dd6d921/ClosedXML.Tests/Excel/CalcEngine/InformationTests.cs#L236: IsNA_NA_True",
        "Expected behavior adapted from this upstream assertion. IsErr NA False. Not derived from Poirot output.",
        "LibreOffice 26.2.6.3 620(Build:3): every retained expected value was independently recalculated on 2026-10-17 through fresh OOXML snapshots and typed cached results. See ../evidence/closedxml-extension-libreoffice.json. This is a Calc reproduction, not a native Excel claim."
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "action": "set",
          "cell": "S!Z100",
          "content": {
            "formula": "IsErr(#N/A)"
          }
        },
        {
          "action": "check",
          "cell": "S!Z100",
          "expected": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "value": false
          }
        },
        {
          "action": "set",
          "cell": "S!Z100",
          "content": {
            "formula": "ISNA(#N/A)"
          }
        },
        {
          "action": "check",
          "cell": "S!Z100",
          "expected": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "value": true
          }
        }
      ]
